1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:02:04,193
Please contact turkision@gmail.com
for any inquiries

2
00:02:04,193 --> 00:02:08,187
NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED DURING
THE FILMING OF THIS PRODUCTION.

3
00:02:08,448 --> 00:02:19,978
Please contact turkision@gmail.com
for any inquiries

4
00:02:30,770 --> 00:02:34,770
That Osman didn't only take your soul...

5
00:02:35,451 --> 00:02:37,861
... he also took your wisdom!

6
00:02:38,549 --> 00:02:44,549
You have forgotten that
you can not trick Balgay!

7
00:02:57,882 --> 00:03:01,882
I will take this new soul from you...

8
00:03:01,954 --> 00:03:07,024
... so that it won't kill your true self!

9
00:03:12,778 --> 00:03:17,348
You will be Kongar again!

10
00:03:21,368 --> 00:03:27,458
You will call Balgay "Father" again!

11
00:03:40,847 --> 00:03:47,137
You will be my best soldier...

12
00:03:49,342 --> 00:03:53,972
... who lunges into the
death fearlessly again.

13
00:05:10,451 --> 00:05:13,941
Why didn't you say that Zöhre
took the poison from that man...

14
00:05:13,941 --> 00:05:15,691
who came to the Tent, Hazal Hatun?

15
00:05:15,733 --> 00:05:19,273
Degenerate. And he says he's a doctor.

16
00:05:20,430 --> 00:05:24,070
- It's not easy to see, Osman!
- What if you were late?

17
00:05:24,070 --> 00:05:25,710
What if something went wrong?

18
00:05:26,344 --> 00:05:28,934
Why did you wait for the meeting?

19
00:05:28,934 --> 00:05:31,394
I wanted to be sure!

20
00:05:33,841 --> 00:05:38,881
Are you interrogating me,
instead of thanking me?

21
00:05:40,190 --> 00:05:43,040
It's not an interrogation,
aunt. It's inquiry.

22
00:05:43,465 --> 00:05:45,915
Osman wants to see who's behind this.

23
00:05:47,969 --> 00:05:53,009
Maybe there wasn't someone behind this.
Maybe she made the poison herself.

24
00:05:54,372 --> 00:05:55,802
I don't think so.

25
00:05:58,501 --> 00:06:04,141
That poison is nothing we know of.
It's potent. Its effects come out later.

26
00:06:05,030 --> 00:06:09,240
She gives the poison to the animal. But it
becomes deadly after the animal is cooked.

27
00:06:10,428 --> 00:06:14,428
What kind of malice is that?
Even the devil wouldn't think of this!

28
00:06:14,486 --> 00:06:16,946
The devil walks amongst us, uncle.

29
00:06:18,662 --> 00:06:20,052
His medicines are lies.

30
00:06:20,805 --> 00:06:24,805
You think that man who we thought was
a Muslim was someone else, Osman?

31
00:06:24,993 --> 00:06:26,623
He is someone else, Hazal Hatun.

32
00:06:26,748 --> 00:06:31,608
So he gave the poison,
instead of medicine.

33
00:06:31,659 --> 00:06:35,399
Who is this snake that came to my home?

34
00:06:35,537 --> 00:06:39,537
We will know about him,
I sent my soldiers after him.

35
00:06:39,583 --> 00:06:43,273
Who do you suspect? Who is behind this?

36
00:06:43,350 --> 00:06:44,490
Sofia.

37
00:06:47,329 --> 00:06:49,659
Isn't that centipede in Constantine?

38
00:06:52,869 --> 00:06:59,829
The poison is Hemlock. It is an ancient,
deadly Greek poison with hemlock in it.

39
00:07:00,929 --> 00:07:03,089
No one could've thought
about this but her.

40
00:07:07,650 --> 00:07:09,560
First, we capture him.

41
00:07:10,848 --> 00:07:13,848
Then we'll see what he has to say.

42
00:07:16,843 --> 00:07:20,843
Konur, it's the castle
is there, after his hill.

43
00:07:21,748 --> 00:07:25,748
That treacherous doctor
will leave his home soon.

44
00:07:25,860 --> 00:07:27,710
We need to be careful, Boran.

45
00:07:28,028 --> 00:07:29,188
Will be.

46
00:07:53,796 --> 00:07:55,506
That's Sugutay.

47
00:07:56,115 --> 00:08:00,115
Stop, brother. Put it down.

48
00:08:12,392 --> 00:08:14,292
They are going to the castle, Boran.

49
00:08:15,694 --> 00:08:17,084
They are going to the castle.

50
00:08:17,195 --> 00:08:23,305
Now we know how Sofia was brave enough
to poison us in the wedding, brother.

51
00:08:23,375 --> 00:08:25,285
Now we know.

52
00:08:31,728 --> 00:08:34,938
How did they survive the poison?

53
00:08:40,734 --> 00:08:41,784
How?

54
00:08:41,794 --> 00:08:45,285
They killed Zöhre Hatun, she
must have exposed herself.

55
00:08:46,472 --> 00:08:48,872
I did my work, Princess Sofia.

56
00:08:49,095 --> 00:08:52,415
Damn your legacy, Osman!

57
00:08:56,238 --> 00:08:59,298
Princess Sofia, Mongol
Commander Sugutay is here.

58
00:09:05,446 --> 00:09:11,456
Osman will track you, hide your
tracks, go to the Nicaea, hurry!

59
00:09:45,376 --> 00:09:47,192
Commander Sugutay.

60
00:09:47,932 --> 00:09:52,242
How good to see you.
If I know you were coming...

61
00:09:52,732 --> 00:09:56,762
I would've given a feast in your honor.

62
00:09:59,682 --> 00:10:00,612
This way.

63
00:10:01,050 --> 00:10:05,670
Here. We will talk here, Sofia.

64
00:10:08,133 --> 00:10:11,043
Under the sky, like a Mongol.

65
00:10:58,503 --> 00:11:00,993
I am so hungry.

66
00:11:03,057 --> 00:11:04,407
Bring the food.

67
00:11:38,837 --> 00:11:42,747
Your tents of rock...

68
00:11:44,326 --> 00:11:50,126
... and your glamour is tiring me, Sofia.

69
00:11:50,224 --> 00:11:55,634
Glamour gives friends trust,
and enemies fear.

70
00:11:55,634 --> 00:11:56,574
Nonsense.

71
00:12:00,372 --> 00:12:01,842
We Mongols...

72
00:12:03,596 --> 00:12:09,396
... believe that we take the soul of the
animal whose heart we eat.

73
00:12:15,815 --> 00:12:18,835
I think you ate chicken hearts.

74
00:12:19,274 --> 00:12:22,894
Seeing that you trapped yourself here.

75
00:12:35,124 --> 00:12:38,064
I came here to give you courage. Take it.

76
00:12:39,431 --> 00:12:43,431
Horse heart. Eat it so that
your eyes are opened.

77
00:12:43,431 --> 00:12:46,511
And your soul is filled with courage.

78
00:12:48,056 --> 00:12:50,066
You will need it.

79
00:12:50,066 --> 00:12:52,796
I like my meat bloody.

80
00:13:02,512 --> 00:13:03,642
I'm listening.

81
00:13:07,597 --> 00:13:11,597
Tell me why I'll need courage.

82
00:13:18,358 --> 00:13:19,388
Geyhatu...

83
00:13:21,163 --> 00:13:23,573
... has returned because of Baydu.

84
00:13:24,081 --> 00:13:29,501
He gave me the mission
to end that devil Osman.

85
00:13:30,859 --> 00:13:33,709
It's not easy to end Osman, Sugutay.

86
00:13:33,776 --> 00:13:35,936
Don't you trust me, woman?

87
00:13:38,031 --> 00:13:40,261
As much as I trust Geyhatu.

88
00:13:42,433 --> 00:13:44,163
What do you want from me?

89
00:13:46,860 --> 00:13:52,140
It's enough for me to make Osman
and his Alps leave the Tent.

90
00:14:12,547 --> 00:14:16,817
It's my job to drive Osman mad
and make him leave the Tent.

91
00:14:19,694 --> 00:14:22,854
And you, what have you got?

92
00:14:28,773 --> 00:14:30,023
I have...

93
00:14:31,829 --> 00:14:36,179
... a betrayal that's going to take
Osman to the spirit realm.

94
00:15:15,171 --> 00:15:16,521
Kill him!

95
00:15:58,109 --> 00:16:00,269
End of the line, dog!

96
00:16:00,414 --> 00:16:02,374
You will die!

97
00:16:14,674 --> 00:16:16,334
I am innocent.

98
00:16:39,129 --> 00:16:40,919
Nice dagger.

99
00:16:41,859 --> 00:16:43,049
Sharp.

100
00:16:43,895 --> 00:16:48,055
But sharp daggers cut their owners first.

101
00:16:54,353 --> 00:16:59,433
If you lie to us, we will
cut your tongue out.

102
00:17:01,275 --> 00:17:02,615
Forgive me!

103
00:17:04,354 --> 00:17:07,204
Zöhre Hatun asked me
to give her the poison.

104
00:17:08,203 --> 00:17:11,083
How could I know she
would do such a thing?

105
00:17:12,699 --> 00:17:16,699
Didn't I tell you I will cut
your tongue out if you lie?

106
00:17:18,660 --> 00:17:19,849
Princess Sofia!

107
00:17:22,983 --> 00:17:24,773
She made me do it.

108
00:17:25,950 --> 00:17:30,300
She threatened me with
my kids! Forgive me.

109
00:17:31,776 --> 00:17:34,286
What were you doing in the castle then?

110
00:17:35,217 --> 00:17:39,637
I told Sofia that I did what I could...

111
00:17:41,419 --> 00:17:45,419
... and to leave my family alone.

112
00:17:55,618 --> 00:17:59,618
These news won't be enough
for us to forgive you.

113
00:18:00,429 --> 00:18:01,949
We need more.

114
00:18:12,193 --> 00:18:13,453
Commander Subutay.

115
00:18:16,130 --> 00:18:18,110
He came to visit Sofia.

116
00:18:19,971 --> 00:18:22,761
They'll move together from now on.

117
00:18:25,645 --> 00:18:31,405
You've tried to turn our feast into
funeral and our Tent into graveyard.

118
00:18:33,122 --> 00:18:38,262
Know that in our custom, we don't
tolerate treachery.

119
00:19:18,045 --> 00:19:21,655
You will kill Osman with this dagger,
Salvador.

120
00:19:27,282 --> 00:19:32,562
By slaughtering soldiers, he left
behind corpses as much as Mount Olympus.

121
00:19:33,877 --> 00:19:37,107
What will we succeed with this dagger,
princess?

122
00:19:40,155 --> 00:19:41,515
This dagger...

123
00:19:45,639 --> 00:19:48,069
...has such a poison on it that...

124
00:19:50,017 --> 00:19:56,437
...a little scar on his body
will be enough to kill him painfully.

125
00:20:09,424 --> 00:20:15,094
With this scar, he'll first feel the
poisoned cold death...

126
00:20:15,184 --> 00:20:21,404
...at the back of his neck.

127
00:20:22,586 --> 00:20:23,636
What about pain?

128
00:20:24,077 --> 00:20:25,397
Is there any pain?

129
00:20:26,035 --> 00:20:27,245
Talk me about that.

130
00:20:28,150 --> 00:20:28,910
Pain.

131
00:20:31,402 --> 00:20:37,922
Pain moves slowly until it covers
his entire body.

132
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:46,390
When he vomits, his life will
flash before his eyes.

133
00:20:47,402 --> 00:20:52,152
He'll question his loyalty and
treachery.

134
00:21:10,305 --> 00:21:15,755
In order to deceive Osman, you've
changed your religion.

135
00:21:20,578 --> 00:21:24,028
You're the person suitable for this job.

136
00:21:37,125 --> 00:21:38,585
Die!

137
00:22:21,185 --> 00:22:21,905
Burçin.

138
00:22:22,192 --> 00:22:23,792
Is that the thing you're
looking for?

139
00:22:23,986 --> 00:22:25,256
Oh, my daughter.

140
00:22:25,758 --> 00:22:26,678
Oh, my Burçin.

141
00:22:28,090 --> 00:22:30,000
Your wound is
still fresh.

142
00:22:30,067 --> 00:22:31,327
Don't tire yourself.

143
00:22:31,719 --> 00:22:33,809
My wound is not on my body.

144
00:22:33,987 --> 00:22:34,957
It's on my heart.

145
00:22:36,048 --> 00:22:38,518
I'll heal the wound on your heart.

146
00:22:38,652 --> 00:22:39,402
I'll heal.

147
00:22:39,672 --> 00:22:43,062
Be careful about the wound on your body.
That's enough.

148
00:22:43,670 --> 00:22:46,910
I don't have the power to stand in front
of you because of what I've done.

149
00:22:47,097 --> 00:22:49,917
But, you forgave me.

150
00:22:50,219 --> 00:22:51,429
Oh, my Burçin.

151
00:22:51,876 --> 00:22:54,006
Nobody is sinless in this world.

152
00:22:54,404 --> 00:22:55,734
Don't think about that.

153
00:22:55,804 --> 00:22:56,964
Don't.

154
00:22:57,342 --> 00:23:01,032
Also, do you know what is inside of this
chest? Look.

155
00:23:02,170 --> 00:23:02,980
Come here.

156
00:23:02,985 --> 00:23:03,715
Come.

157
00:23:10,307 --> 00:23:12,517
Bismillahirrahmanirahim. (in the name of Allah,
the compassionate, the merciful)

158
00:23:35,973 --> 00:23:39,973
Allah. Allah is my witness.

159
00:23:41,084 --> 00:23:46,384
I didn't preach my Aybars anything
except the remark of Allah.

160
00:23:49,210 --> 00:23:53,210
When he was a little boy, he started
to read it.

161
00:23:54,156 --> 00:23:57,166
He insisted on being mollah.

162
00:23:57,659 --> 00:23:58,779
Then, he didn't.

163
00:23:59,563 --> 00:24:00,503
He just didn't.

164
00:24:06,722 --> 00:24:08,412
Oh, my Burçin.

165
00:24:10,435 --> 00:24:11,875
Oh, my Burçin.

166
00:24:13,422 --> 00:24:14,842
Praise be!

167
00:24:17,608 --> 00:24:18,718
My Burçin.

168
00:24:33,780 --> 00:24:40,800
My Aybars grow up with this flag.

169
00:24:42,273 --> 00:24:46,273
He saw all dreams in which
this flag was waving.

170
00:24:46,480 --> 00:24:47,970
All dreams.

171
00:24:55,722 --> 00:24:57,342
My Burçin.

172
00:25:01,442 --> 00:25:08,062
This dagger is the first dagger that
I attached to his waistline.

173
00:25:16,168 --> 00:25:21,658
He first killed a Mongol unbeliever
with this dagger.

174
00:25:21,968 --> 00:25:23,768
With this dagger.

175
00:25:31,135 --> 00:25:37,315
Now, all of these belong to Sıddık.

176
00:25:38,232 --> 00:25:40,472
But these are the
belongings of Aybars.

177
00:25:40,939 --> 00:25:42,669
And also who is Sıddık?

178
00:25:43,593 --> 00:25:50,753
Sıddık is the second son which Allah
gave to me, my Burçin.

179
00:25:53,059 --> 00:25:58,519
He is the rose that blossoms in winter
and the snow that falls in summer.

180
00:25:59,535 --> 00:26:04,235
Now, he will come to the Tent to kiss my
hand.

181
00:26:04,961 --> 00:26:07,301
When he comes, I'll introduce you to him.

182
00:26:07,573 --> 00:26:08,763
I will.

183
00:26:22,451 --> 00:26:27,001
Did you feel the cold breath of death
on the back of your head, Salvador?

184
00:26:29,105 --> 00:26:33,105
The death is reuniting with
our Allah for us.

185
00:26:38,959 --> 00:26:41,329
Before you reunite with your God...

186
00:26:41,417 --> 00:26:46,287
...I'll reunite you with Osman whom
you trust faithfully, Salvador.

187
00:26:51,775 --> 00:26:52,875
I liked you.

188
00:26:53,958 --> 00:26:55,578
Princess Sofia.

189
00:26:58,539 --> 00:27:00,169
You're a funny woman.

190
00:27:12,137 --> 00:27:12,857
Now.

191
00:27:17,158 --> 00:27:22,268
Go to osman and say that...

192
00:27:44,496 --> 00:27:45,606
Did you make him speak?

193
00:27:45,697 --> 00:27:47,057
Fortunately, my bey.

194
00:27:48,141 --> 00:27:49,311
What did that dog say?

195
00:27:49,448 --> 00:27:53,058
I wasn't mistaken, my bey. He works for Sofia.
He got out of the castle.

196
00:27:53,718 --> 00:27:55,248
But there's an another problem.

197
00:27:55,456 --> 00:27:57,596
You were right about your doubts, my bey.

198
00:27:57,841 --> 00:28:00,111
Subutay is collaborating with Sofia.

199
00:28:00,619 --> 00:28:02,899
We saw his soldiers while
going to that castle.

200
00:28:03,714 --> 00:28:07,434
After Alişar died, he found a new
ally.

201
00:28:09,420 --> 00:28:12,350
Subutay should have gone to
Geyhatu with that greed.

202
00:28:13,488 --> 00:28:17,658
As he didn't, he is planning
something new.

203
00:28:20,622 --> 00:28:25,192
We need to take precautions in the
Tent without giving it out.

204
00:28:25,615 --> 00:28:27,585
We can't know what they will do.

205
00:28:27,711 --> 00:28:28,971
You speak right, brother.

206
00:28:29,130 --> 00:28:30,050
Thanks.

207
00:29:23,165 --> 00:29:25,375
What this red devil is doing in here?

208
00:29:26,437 --> 00:29:30,027
What this red devil is doing in here?

209
00:29:33,054 --> 00:29:34,464
I know her.

210
00:29:35,911 --> 00:29:37,111
Her words are effective.

211
00:29:38,311 --> 00:29:39,991
Did she poison you as well?

212
00:29:40,137 --> 00:29:44,817
Anger is no use for any of us.
Balgay.

213
00:29:48,575 --> 00:29:54,675
Either you'll kill each other or
you'll kill Osman together.

214
00:30:06,837 --> 00:30:10,987
Geyhatu came back because of Baydu threat.

215
00:30:11,803 --> 00:30:15,323
He ordered me to kill Osman.

216
00:30:15,650 --> 00:30:16,650
I know Osman.

217
00:30:18,269 --> 00:30:20,709
We've both set off and
gone to the war with him.

218
00:30:22,089 --> 00:30:23,729
He has willpower like an iron.

219
00:30:24,408 --> 00:30:25,678
This won't be easy.

220
00:30:27,191 --> 00:30:28,831
I saw him as well.

221
00:30:29,724 --> 00:30:31,624
Poor Turkmen has scared you.

222
00:30:33,308 --> 00:30:37,568
The last thing that Sofia had done
will drive him crazy.

223
00:30:39,236 --> 00:30:45,926
Salvador was a soldier that
Osman placed next to me.

224
00:30:47,162 --> 00:30:52,262
I poisoned and sent him to
Osman as a wedding gift.

225
00:30:56,903 --> 00:31:00,083
You are such a devil that...

226
00:31:01,452 --> 00:31:04,592
...you will spoil his wedding.

227
00:31:08,264 --> 00:31:11,724
I thought this woman was a coward.

228
00:31:12,537 --> 00:31:17,307
But it seems that Yannis made her
brave while she was young.

229
00:31:21,098 --> 00:31:28,568
Now, we need a move to trap Osman who
went crazy.

230
00:31:29,187 --> 00:31:30,737
That's the easiest one.

231
00:31:32,124 --> 00:31:40,884
The blonde berserker who will trap
Osman is staying there.

232
00:31:46,989 --> 00:31:55,819
Now, by possessing his soul I will
make him a wild bird.

233
00:32:11,160 --> 00:32:14,300
Did your magic work, the great shaman?

234
00:32:14,871 --> 00:32:16,881
Did you capture his soul?

235
00:32:20,020 --> 00:32:21,480
Wake up him then.

236
00:32:26,439 --> 00:32:29,009
Wake up wild bird.

237
00:32:58,489 --> 00:32:59,377
Kongar.

238
00:33:02,082 --> 00:33:03,052
My son.

239
00:33:05,466 --> 00:33:06,256
Father.

240
00:33:10,023 --> 00:33:11,613
What happened to me?

241
00:33:14,296 --> 00:33:21,866
The mean man named
Osman has stolen your soul.

242
00:33:24,530 --> 00:33:28,940
The great shaman wanted it
back...

243
00:33:30,289 --> 00:33:32,549
...and took it.

244
00:33:36,161 --> 00:33:39,601
Are you ready for listening my orders,
my son?

245
00:34:27,914 --> 00:34:28,934
Sıddık.

246
00:34:29,100 --> 00:34:31,290
Who is that? Sıddık?

247
00:34:35,991 --> 00:34:37,051
Help us.

248
00:34:42,030 --> 00:34:43,360
Hurry! Come on!

249
00:34:44,435 --> 00:34:45,195
Sıddık.

250
00:34:55,866 --> 00:34:56,826
Sıddık.

251
00:34:57,450 --> 00:34:58,200
Sıddık.

252
00:34:58,508 --> 00:34:59,418
Sıddık.

253
00:35:06,757 --> 00:35:08,017
Sıddık.

254
00:35:08,399 --> 00:35:11,159
Brother. Who did it to you?

255
00:35:14,762 --> 00:35:15,942
Sofia.

256
00:35:21,770 --> 00:35:26,660
She told me that she went back to take his
father revenge.

257
00:35:31,393 --> 00:35:33,733
Son.

258
00:35:34,003 --> 00:35:37,360
Sıddık. My son, son...

259
00:35:42,784 --> 00:35:46,524
Sıddık, my son.

260
00:35:46,725 --> 00:35:48,275
Don't leave me.

261
00:35:48,386 --> 00:35:51,596
Look. I am here.
I am here. Don't be afraid.

262
00:35:51,627 --> 00:35:53,087
Don't be afraid.

263
00:35:53,543 --> 00:35:57,843
Stay strong, son.
Stay strong, Sıddık!

264
00:35:59,883 --> 00:36:03,883
- Father...
- Yes, son. Tell me.

265
00:36:04,428 --> 00:36:05,688
Tell me.

266
00:36:18,530 --> 00:36:21,690
Kongar...
My blonde berserker.

267
00:36:22,966 --> 00:36:26,966
My angel of death,
bright like the sun...

268
00:36:28,382 --> 00:36:30,862
You'll go to the Kayı Tent.

269
00:36:31,211 --> 00:36:38,111
You'll tell them that you're compromised
and bring Osman to Kartal beech.

270
00:36:38,765 --> 00:36:45,185
Then you'll take your revenge from
that fool who stole your soul.

271
00:36:47,672 --> 00:36:49,782
As you order, father.

272
00:36:51,794 --> 00:36:53,744
Osman is a traitor.

273
00:36:54,697 --> 00:36:55,777
He will die.

274
00:37:00,508 --> 00:37:02,638
Kongar will kill him.

275
00:37:32,377 --> 00:37:39,947
The bait is on its way.
While Kongar brings Osman...

276
00:37:40,339 --> 00:37:43,999
... we'll prepare for the ambush.

277
00:37:48,062 --> 00:37:51,732
Both Osman and Kayı Tent will end.

278
00:37:57,294 --> 00:38:03,074
You promised! Sıddık, you promised!
Stay with me. Stay with me!

279
00:38:03,074 --> 00:38:07,804
Hold on!
Hold on, Sıddık! Hold on, son!

280
00:38:10,017 --> 00:38:13,677
G--
Give your blessings, father.

281
00:38:13,936 --> 00:38:15,636
No, no.

282
00:38:20,903 --> 00:38:32,613
[Kalima Shahadah]

283
00:38:46,309 --> 00:38:48,199
No...

284
00:38:55,506 --> 00:38:59,506
You promised...

285
00:38:59,946 --> 00:39:01,926
I'll be your Aybars, you said...

286
00:39:03,138 --> 00:39:07,368
I won't go anywhere,
I'll stay with you, you said.

287
00:39:45,454 --> 00:39:50,274
Thank Allah for giving me such a fate.

288
00:39:54,499 --> 00:39:57,479
Thank Allah for giving me such a fate.

289
00:40:01,620 --> 00:40:03,450
What if he died as an infidel?

290
00:40:05,603 --> 00:40:07,343
What if he was from the cruel ones?

291
00:40:10,835 --> 00:40:14,835
Thank my Allah...

292
00:40:16,452 --> 00:40:19,982
... that he died as a believer.

293
00:40:28,547 --> 00:40:29,877
My Allah...

294
00:40:31,300 --> 00:40:34,610
... accept him to Hz. Hamza's lodge.

295
00:40:34,750 --> 00:40:36,330
- Amen.
- Amen.

296
00:40:36,330 --> 00:40:39,440
Accept him to Hz. Hamza's lodge.

297
00:40:39,695 --> 00:40:40,895
Amen.

298
00:40:45,565 --> 00:40:46,975
My Osman!

299
00:40:48,228 --> 00:40:52,408
This is the second son Sofia took from me.

300
00:40:55,157 --> 00:40:57,197
The second son, my Osman.

301
00:41:01,227 --> 00:41:06,487
There isn't enough space in this world
for me and Sofia, Bamsı Bey.

302
00:41:17,884 --> 00:41:25,484
Start preparing! After burying our martyr,
we'll do what's necessary!

303
00:41:25,576 --> 00:41:27,656
As you order, my Bey!

304
00:41:31,816 --> 00:41:33,896
We're witnesses, dear Allah!

305
00:41:36,556 --> 00:41:40,526
He came as a Catalon,
he went as a Turk!

306
00:41:40,588 --> 00:41:42,508
- We're witnesses, dear Allah!
- We're witnesses, dear Allah!

307
00:41:43,023 --> 00:41:48,543
He came as a Christian,
he went as a Muslim!

308
00:41:48,543 --> 00:41:50,365
- We're witnesses, dear Allah!
- We're witnesses, dear Allah!

309
00:41:52,925 --> 00:41:57,385
He was lost,
then he found the way.

310
00:41:57,881 --> 00:41:59,761
- We're witnesses, dear Allah!
- We're witnesses, dear Allah!

311
00:42:01,604 --> 00:42:05,604
We're witnesses, dear Allah.
We are!

312
00:42:05,786 --> 00:42:07,596
We're witnesses, my Bamsı Bey!

313
00:42:09,077 --> 00:42:13,307
The entire world will be witnesses
once we take our revenge!

314
00:42:16,495 --> 00:42:17,875
My Osman...

315
00:42:23,768 --> 00:42:26,298
We'll bury him next to my Aybars.

316
00:42:28,374 --> 00:42:34,624
So that they can be together
in the afterlife.

317
00:42:36,197 --> 00:42:38,217
So that they can be together.

318
00:42:42,030 --> 00:42:43,650
Don't worry.

319
00:42:49,958 --> 00:42:51,098
Come on.

320
00:42:55,770 --> 00:42:58,450
- Easy.
- Let's go.

321
00:42:59,782 --> 00:43:03,782
My Aybars is with me.
We'll bury him next to my Aybars.

322
00:44:06,164 --> 00:44:07,654
Let's go, Osman.

323
00:44:32,324 --> 00:44:36,064
My father, Osman,
everyone should pray for you.

324
00:44:36,287 --> 00:44:38,997
That traitor Zöhre was about
to kill the whole Tent.

325
00:44:40,332 --> 00:44:49,112
Back then, I knew how to get her when
she tricked them to exile you, but...

326
00:44:49,825 --> 00:44:52,495
... there is a time for everything, son.

327
00:44:53,202 --> 00:44:57,792
Patience is hard,
but its fruits are sweet. Remember that.

328
00:44:58,722 --> 00:45:03,573
You're right, mother. I've witnessed
the misery you've gone through.

329
00:45:04,686 --> 00:45:07,506
You grieved for me and also my father.

330
00:45:08,993 --> 00:45:13,453
But as you've said,
there is a time for everything.

331
00:45:15,171 --> 00:45:19,171
The time has come.
But I can't do it alone.

332
00:45:19,521 --> 00:45:20,781
You will help.

333
00:45:21,025 --> 00:45:22,835
Anything you want, mother.

334
00:45:25,119 --> 00:45:29,999
Gündüz Bey has no power in the Tent.

335
00:45:31,844 --> 00:45:35,844
Osman can be regarded as the Tent's Bey.

336
00:45:36,336 --> 00:45:40,956
He'll be the Bey after his father dies.

337
00:45:41,868 --> 00:45:45,128
You...
But you are...

338
00:45:45,128 --> 00:45:48,358
... the nephew of
Muzafferidun Yavlak Hasan.

339
00:45:48,718 --> 00:45:50,188
You're his pride.

340
00:45:51,097 --> 00:45:52,867
Remember.

341
00:45:54,104 --> 00:46:00,824
Always remember why he sent you here.

342
00:46:03,745 --> 00:46:09,995
The power and might of the Kayıs are
the keys to these lands.

343
00:46:11,516 --> 00:46:16,376
Those who hold those keys control
the borders.

344
00:46:20,487 --> 00:46:21,957
What about Osman?

345
00:46:22,993 --> 00:46:24,283
What'll we do about him?

346
00:46:26,871 --> 00:46:29,831
Osman isn't our issue.

347
00:46:30,842 --> 00:46:35,482
Geyhatu will deal with him.

348
00:46:37,349 --> 00:46:39,359
The problem comes after Osman.

349
00:46:39,961 --> 00:46:45,831
Kayıs have to survive and recover in you
and your father's hands.

350
00:46:46,138 --> 00:46:49,118
That's what your uncle wants.
Understood?

351
00:46:50,548 --> 00:46:52,822
Understood, mother.

352
00:46:54,856 --> 00:46:58,856
You should stay close to Osman.

353
00:46:59,107 --> 00:47:01,797
You'll gain his trust.

354
00:47:02,189 --> 00:47:06,189
If necessary, you'll sacrifice your
life for him. I shouldn't say that.

355
00:47:07,881 --> 00:47:10,901
Or you will pretend.

356
00:47:13,215 --> 00:47:17,695
I waited for this day
in my brother's Tent.

357
00:47:18,421 --> 00:47:21,701
With patience, endeavour...

358
00:47:22,444 --> 00:47:25,994
I waited with great effort!

359
00:47:28,382 --> 00:47:31,072
This is the day.

360
00:47:34,371 --> 00:47:37,761
Without taking
my revenge for all those years...

361
00:47:38,413 --> 00:47:42,413
... without taking control
of these borders...

362
00:47:43,264 --> 00:47:45,034
... I won't let this go.

363
00:47:47,534 --> 00:47:51,534
As long as you listen to my words, son.

364
00:48:24,168 --> 00:48:26,698
They've hastily married.

365
00:48:27,457 --> 00:48:32,847
They've sacrificed many, many animals.

366
00:48:37,441 --> 00:48:40,021
They've ruined a young bride.

367
00:48:40,971 --> 00:48:42,481
They ruined her.

368
00:48:58,088 --> 00:48:59,638
Brother!

369
00:49:08,520 --> 00:49:10,820
Why are you staying away, brother?

370
00:49:15,731 --> 00:49:17,341
Don't go, brother!

371
00:49:19,354 --> 00:49:21,124
Brother! Stay!

372
00:49:24,380 --> 00:49:25,840
Brother!

373
00:49:26,062 --> 00:49:29,232
Bismillahirrahmanirrahim
[in the name of Allah, the merciful and compassionate.]

374
00:49:38,794 --> 00:49:41,134
You see...

375
00:49:43,107 --> 00:49:48,357
Your wisdom can't be questioned,
Abdurrahman Gazi.

376
00:49:56,365 --> 00:50:00,745
Our Allah who shows us the light of day...

377
00:50:00,781 --> 00:50:05,371
... takes our children to
his side one by one.

378
00:50:07,274 --> 00:50:11,954
As you see now,
both of them lay side by side.

379
00:50:13,979 --> 00:50:16,779
May Allah put them
in the same place, brother.

380
00:50:17,348 --> 00:50:21,758
I hope we have the same testimony as them.

381
00:50:22,049 --> 00:50:25,309
Amen, Abdurrahman Gazi.

382
00:50:26,134 --> 00:50:27,254
Amen.

383
00:50:34,929 --> 00:50:36,349
Göktuğ?

384
00:50:42,935 --> 00:50:44,235
Göktuğ!

385
00:50:46,376 --> 00:50:48,606
Göktuğ!

386
00:50:49,489 --> 00:50:51,049
Are you okay, brother?

387
00:50:51,049 --> 00:50:54,539
Who did this to you?
Who did this to you, Göktuğ?

388
00:50:55,033 --> 00:50:57,013
Balgay found everything out.

389
00:51:00,162 --> 00:51:01,732
I've been compromised.

390
00:51:02,073 --> 00:51:04,363
I hardly got away.

391
00:51:05,329 --> 00:51:08,819
If I stay with him,
I can only die alone.

392
00:51:08,819 --> 00:51:11,919
From now on, there's only death
for Balgay, brother!

393
00:51:12,306 --> 00:51:15,376
Not to you! Only to Balgay!

394
00:51:15,376 --> 00:51:17,226
Where is that degenerate?

395
00:51:17,226 --> 00:51:22,126
He established his base at Kartal beech.

396
00:51:24,159 --> 00:51:26,569
He's working with Sofia and Subutay.

397
00:51:26,849 --> 00:51:28,299
He sold you out.

398
00:51:30,510 --> 00:51:33,910
My Osman!
We should go and take their lives!

399
00:51:35,852 --> 00:51:38,732
We knew about Sofia
and Subutay's alliance.

400
00:51:39,482 --> 00:51:42,082
Since Balgay wants to beef with us...

401
00:51:43,123 --> 00:51:46,573
... then he deserves an earlier death.

402
00:51:48,296 --> 00:51:51,676
Brother. You and Abdurrahman Gazi
should stay at the Tent.

403
00:51:52,373 --> 00:51:54,413
Keep your eyes wide open.

404
00:51:55,796 --> 00:51:57,996
Çetin and Ayaz should be with you.

405
00:51:57,996 --> 00:51:59,636
Don't worry, brother.

406
00:52:04,267 --> 00:52:11,147
Our enemies are working together
to destroy us.

407
00:52:14,752 --> 00:52:18,872
They want the Turkishness to end.

408
00:52:18,872 --> 00:52:24,642
They don't want any Muslim left.

409
00:52:25,402 --> 00:52:27,742
But they don't know that...

410
00:52:27,998 --> 00:52:32,618
A place with a Turkish gravestone...

411
00:52:33,895 --> 00:52:35,555
... is our homeland.

412
00:52:39,766 --> 00:52:43,766
This is the day we'll teach this to them.

413
00:52:44,656 --> 00:52:51,826
- Allahu Akbar!
- Allahu Akbar!

414
00:52:58,960 --> 00:53:00,360
Come, brother.

415
00:53:03,382 --> 00:53:04,852
Come, Göktuğ.

416
00:53:07,118 --> 00:53:10,318
Göktuğ! Are you okay?

417
00:53:11,327 --> 00:53:12,977
My dear brother!

418
00:53:46,368 --> 00:53:52,038
I'll attack from the front with my Nökers.

419
00:53:54,289 --> 00:53:59,329
The lucky ones will be crushed
by our horses.

420
00:54:01,697 --> 00:54:06,567
The others will taste
our naphthalized arrows.

421
00:54:10,334 --> 00:54:13,534
Some will try to escape from here.

422
00:54:15,284 --> 00:54:20,054
Your soldiers will hold the Tent's exit.

423
00:54:25,917 --> 00:54:30,927
No one will get out of there alive.

424
00:54:33,769 --> 00:54:37,169
I'll be commanding my soldiers,
Commander Subutay.

425
00:54:41,569 --> 00:54:45,569
I waited a long time to hear them
beg for their lives.

426
00:54:48,589 --> 00:54:53,529
But we shouldn't underestimate Kayı Tent.

427
00:54:54,500 --> 00:55:00,960
I know many people who tried to kill them
but lost their own lives.

428
00:55:13,202 --> 00:55:15,402
Not a simple death...

429
00:55:16,685 --> 00:55:20,685
I'll give them hell.

430
00:55:40,413 --> 00:55:42,433
What are you doing here, Bahadır?

431
00:55:43,018 --> 00:55:48,288
While the horses of my Tent are running
for battle, I can't sit and wait, Osman Bey.

432
00:55:51,787 --> 00:55:53,487
What do you wish from me?

433
00:55:54,411 --> 00:55:56,531
I know that you're angry towards me.

434
00:55:56,966 --> 00:55:59,656
A lot happened because of my carelessness.

435
00:56:00,569 --> 00:56:02,779
But I'm regretful, Osman Bey.

436
00:56:03,342 --> 00:56:06,482
If you allow me,
I'd like to be by your side.

437
00:56:10,657 --> 00:56:15,597
Our path is harsh.
It's not for those whose lives are sweet.

438
00:56:15,760 --> 00:56:19,460
Osman Bey, won't you accept it
for my brother Batur's sake?

439
00:56:19,803 --> 00:56:23,493
If my life is sweet, I'll sacrifice it
for your cause!

440
00:56:30,227 --> 00:56:31,697
Come, then.

441
00:56:52,993 --> 00:56:55,913
Selcan Hatun! Bala Hatun! Come!

442
00:56:55,970 --> 00:56:58,760
What happened, daughter?

443
00:56:58,760 --> 00:57:00,910
- Aygül isn't here!
- What do you mean?

444
00:57:01,106 --> 00:57:04,116
She isn't here! She went to her tent
to sleep.

445
00:57:04,349 --> 00:57:09,149
I went to look and she wasn't there.
I've searched the whole tent.

446
00:57:09,607 --> 00:57:12,477
- Oh no!
- I asked everyone.

447
00:57:12,477 --> 00:57:16,527
No one saw her.
What will we do, Selcan Hatun?

448
00:57:16,527 --> 00:57:20,127
Relax, daughter. We'll find her.
Did you inform Hazal Hatun?

449
00:57:20,127 --> 00:57:23,217
I couldn't find her.
Do you think they left together?

450
00:57:23,217 --> 00:57:26,677
I don't think so. Hazal Hatun was near
the pavilion. I just saw her.

451
00:57:26,677 --> 00:57:31,697
Whatever it is! We'll find Aygül. She's
out of her mind. May Allah protect her!

452
00:57:31,697 --> 00:57:34,937
We need to find her before it gets dark.
Alps!

453
00:57:36,259 --> 00:57:40,389
Aygül isn't here! Inform Dündar Bey.
We'll look for her. go!

454
00:57:40,389 --> 00:57:42,129
- Okay, Selcan Hatun.
- Okay, Selcan Hatun.

455
00:57:58,013 --> 00:57:59,503
Osman Bey!

456
00:58:05,804 --> 00:58:07,654
We'll walk from here.

457
00:58:08,431 --> 00:58:10,871
They're on the other side of the hill.

458
00:58:13,346 --> 00:58:16,776
Göktuğ...
You don't look okay.

459
00:58:17,568 --> 00:58:19,978
- You should stay here.
- Osman Bey...

460
00:58:20,098 --> 00:58:23,288
Allow me to be with you while you
get that dog Balgay.

461
00:58:23,871 --> 00:58:27,261
Don't deny me my revenge.

462
00:58:44,685 --> 00:58:50,965
Bamsı Bey. We'll go from here.
You surround the flank.

463
00:58:51,783 --> 00:58:54,313
We will, my Osman.

464
00:58:54,558 --> 00:58:56,878
For my brother Batur, Osman Bey!

465
00:58:57,158 --> 00:59:02,018
Valiants! For my sons!

466
00:59:07,258 --> 00:59:09,248
For all our martyrs!

467
00:59:11,954 --> 00:59:14,694
Let's go.
Let's go, valiants!

468
01:02:17,935 --> 01:02:20,111
What should we do?
Should we seperate?

469
01:02:20,906 --> 01:02:23,659
Mother, I know where she is heading to.

470
01:02:25,128 --> 01:02:27,243
What's in your mind? Speak.

471
01:02:28,002 --> 01:02:30,938
She is with the one who she is
crazy about.

472
01:02:34,723 --> 01:02:35,955
Come on.

473
01:02:47,947 --> 01:02:49,422
Hide! Move!

474
01:03:02,523 --> 01:03:05,476
-Hazal...
''Hazal Hatun seems pretty dignified''

475
01:03:05,908 --> 01:03:08,290
Yes, she is so dignified.

476
01:03:08,507 --> 01:03:11,202
Humans hide their real pattern inside.

477
01:03:11,349 --> 01:03:13,622
Indeed, indeed.

478
01:03:13,622 --> 01:03:16,232
Why did she come here after all
these years?

479
01:03:16,917 --> 01:03:18,687
Only for Bahadır?

480
01:03:20,443 --> 01:03:22,265
I don't think so.

481
01:03:22,750 --> 01:03:25,443
She is using an iron hand in a
velvet glove...

482
01:03:27,138 --> 01:03:30,234
...I'd say that she is planning something.
- You are right, son.

483
01:03:31,987 --> 01:03:34,506
''Don't you worry. I'll keep an eye
on her.''

484
01:03:37,242 --> 01:03:39,213
Where is she going to with such hurry?

485
01:03:42,215 --> 01:03:43,494
Bala, my girl.

486
01:03:44,418 --> 01:03:47,428
I hope you are right.
You go and find Aygül.

487
01:03:50,678 --> 01:03:53,887
And I'll go after her.
Let's see what she is after.

488
01:03:55,251 --> 01:03:57,959
- Be careful, mother.
- Don't worry.

489
01:03:58,087 --> 01:03:59,065
Come on.

490
01:04:42,279 --> 01:04:44,357
Two dogs cAme together...

491
01:04:44,872 --> 01:04:46,819
... and talk about our death.

492
01:04:50,664 --> 01:04:52,867
It's time for revenge, Osman Bey.

493
01:04:54,134 --> 01:04:56,273
It's time to wash the blood with blood.

494
01:04:57,617 --> 01:05:01,248
It's time to take revenge from Balgay for
all the things he had done to us.

495
01:05:18,757 --> 01:05:20,306
Come then, Osman.

496
01:05:47,241 --> 01:05:48,771
With the name of Allah!

497
01:06:00,876 --> 01:06:02,664
Balgay!

498
01:06:21,956 --> 01:06:24,101
My Bey, it is a trap.

499
01:06:49,933 --> 01:06:51,159
Osman...

500
01:06:53,462 --> 01:06:57,761
For you and your warriors...

501
01:06:58,623 --> 01:07:02,413
...I summoned Erlik Khan's sons.

502
01:07:08,110 --> 01:07:11,261
Baybadur the Stonehand...

503
01:07:13,439 --> 01:07:17,980
...Karaş, God of Darkness...

504
01:07:19,698 --> 01:07:23,838
...Kerey Khan, Yabaş Khan, Badış Khan...

505
01:07:24,437 --> 01:07:28,261
...Kömür Khan, Karaş Khan...

506
01:07:29,696 --> 01:07:31,840
They all gathered...

507
01:07:32,291 --> 01:07:34,884
...for the bottles of blood...

508
01:07:35,457 --> 01:07:39,035
...that I will offer to them.
Nine holy sons of Erlik Khan...

509
01:07:39,419 --> 01:07:45,313
...with the feast of souls I
offer you...

510
01:07:45,313 --> 01:07:48,306
...surround all around!

511
01:07:51,708 --> 01:07:56,276
I offer Osman to your father...

512
01:07:58,784 --> 01:08:02,435
...accept it.

513
01:08:10,362 --> 01:08:13,089
Göktuğ!
Göktuğ!

514
01:08:13,375 --> 01:08:14,780
Göktuğ!

515
01:08:29,920 --> 01:08:31,863
Göktuğ...

516
01:08:33,214 --> 01:08:34,316
Konur...

517
01:08:49,069 --> 01:08:51,265
What have they done to you, Göktuğ?

518
01:09:35,584 --> 01:09:38,078
Valiants, brave men...

519
01:09:39,143 --> 01:09:41,270
Now, this is the place.

520
01:09:44,104 --> 01:09:47,877
Come on now. Come on, come on.

521
01:09:56,881 --> 01:10:00,216
I got my son's soul back, Osman.

522
01:10:01,603 --> 01:10:05,308
You can never take a Mongol's soul.

523
01:10:08,642 --> 01:10:13,387
We came from Allah and we
will go to Allah.

524
01:10:32,820 --> 01:10:34,317
Göktuğ...

525
01:10:37,949 --> 01:10:40,380
Break your chains, brother!

526
01:10:41,696 --> 01:10:43,224
For your brother!

527
01:10:43,305 --> 01:10:46,921
For your mother and father whom
they killed, turn back to Allah.

528
01:10:49,799 --> 01:10:50,854
Göktuğ...

529
01:10:52,934 --> 01:10:54,023
Göktuğ!

530
01:10:54,203 --> 01:10:57,636
Göktuğ's soul is with blue skies
and dark clouds.

531
01:10:58,322 --> 01:11:01,403
The one standing here is Kongar...

532
01:11:01,525 --> 01:11:04,113
...my son, Kongar.

533
01:11:05,290 --> 01:11:14,170
Erlik Khan, I offer you Osman's soul.

534
01:11:16,858 --> 01:11:18,042
Göktuğ!

535
01:11:53,418 --> 01:11:55,901
Now you say...

536
01:11:56,227 --> 01:12:00,129
...why did Hazal Hatun return
to the Tent?

537
01:12:01,791 --> 01:12:05,356
After all this time, which wind
led her here?

538
01:12:06,915 --> 01:12:11,339
You should know that it wasn't a
wind that brought me here.

539
01:12:12,119 --> 01:12:15,435
It is fire. The fire of children in
my heart.

540
01:12:16,295 --> 01:12:19,975
We will see, Hazal Hatun.
Is is the fire of children...

541
01:12:20,427 --> 01:12:22,213
...or some other plans...

542
01:12:23,361 --> 01:12:25,205
...we will see.

543
01:12:40,668 --> 01:12:43,621
Remember your testimony with
your pure heart, Göktuğ.

544
01:12:44,341 --> 01:12:46,165
Huh, brother?

545
01:12:47,387 --> 01:12:54,445
May dark souls take Osman's soul
to Erlik Khan.

546
01:13:20,708 --> 01:13:23,130
Now we are face to face, Osman.

547
01:14:11,558 --> 01:14:13,424
Cerkutay...

548
01:14:14,780 --> 01:14:17,860
Cerkutay...
Cerkutay...

549
01:14:22,595 --> 01:14:27,506
I heard that Salvador is gone, as well.

550
01:14:40,046 --> 01:14:42,971
How many children will you
sacrifice for Osman Bey?

551
01:14:52,652 --> 01:14:56,168
Did you think that...

552
01:14:56,636 --> 01:14:59,568
...we will be out of children to sacrifice
for homeland?

553
01:15:01,199 --> 01:15:02,696
Stupid man.

554
01:15:05,727 --> 01:15:07,262
Cerkutay.

555
01:15:07,823 --> 01:15:11,441
Are you high?

556
01:15:15,053 --> 01:15:17,159
Take your guard, Cerkutay.

557
01:15:48,640 --> 01:15:53,657
If a father doesn't behead a red
handed heathen...

558
01:15:54,281 --> 01:15:57,426
...how can he face Allah in
the other world.

559
01:17:26,640 --> 01:17:30,108
Boran, Bahadır, warriors!
Osman is in danger.

560
01:17:30,599 --> 01:17:32,996
Come on, come on.
Come with me.

561
01:17:37,305 --> 01:17:39,465
Aygül Hatun!

562
01:17:39,758 --> 01:17:41,581
Aygül, my girl!

563
01:17:41,938 --> 01:17:43,811
Aygül Hatun.

564
01:17:44,194 --> 01:17:46,401
Aygül, my Aygül!

565
01:17:47,401 --> 01:17:49,659
- Aygül Hatun!
- My girl, where are you?

566
01:17:50,332 --> 01:17:52,978
- Aygül!
- Aygül!

567
01:17:54,122 --> 01:17:56,283
My Aygül...

568
01:17:57,289 --> 01:17:59,691
Aygül Hatun!

569
01:18:00,418 --> 01:18:03,656
Uncle, calm down.
We will find Aygül.

570
01:18:04,059 --> 01:18:06,397
How will we find her, my nephew?

571
01:18:06,468 --> 01:18:09,603
This is a giant forest.
Who knows where she went.

572
01:18:10,058 --> 01:18:13,678
We will find her.
Selcan aunt is after her.

573
01:18:14,268 --> 01:18:17,044
Maybe they will find her before us.

574
01:18:18,429 --> 01:18:20,876
Don't be like this. Don't worry.

575
01:18:21,514 --> 01:18:23,962
We will find her. May Allah help us.

576
01:18:24,496 --> 01:18:27,042
- We will.
- Inshallah, my nephew. Inshallah.

577
01:18:29,193 --> 01:18:32,076
Aygül!

578
01:18:36,759 --> 01:18:39,694
My Allah, help my girl.

579
01:18:40,768 --> 01:18:43,155
Don't let me face this pain.

580
01:18:44,626 --> 01:18:46,265
I can't bear it.

581
01:18:48,274 --> 01:18:50,330
Protect my daughter.

582
01:18:54,566 --> 01:18:56,755
Aygül Hatun!

583
01:18:56,755 --> 01:18:58,969
Aygül! My girl!

584
01:19:00,337 --> 01:19:02,256
Where are you?

585
01:19:02,557 --> 01:19:05,051
My child, my girl,
where are you?

586
01:19:33,627 --> 01:19:36,474
What are you after, Hazal Hatun?

587
01:19:37,371 --> 01:19:40,163
What are you doing?

588
01:19:45,404 --> 01:19:47,971
Who is this?

589
01:19:51,515 --> 01:19:56,273
I won't wait for you!
You will come first and wait for me!

590
01:19:57,143 --> 01:19:59,420
- Did you understand?
- Yes, Hazal Hatun.

591
01:20:00,665 --> 01:20:02,315
Now...

592
01:20:03,186 --> 01:20:05,686
I'm listening.
Tell me.

593
01:20:06,036 --> 01:20:07,656
What news did you bring?

594
01:20:07,656 --> 01:20:10,336
I brought Muzafferidun Yavlak
Hasan's news.

595
01:20:10,426 --> 01:20:12,766
The things I'll tell you are
rather important.

596
01:20:31,962 --> 01:20:37,072
You told me to stay alive
until we got even.

597
01:20:38,902 --> 01:20:43,182
This is where we get even, Osman.

598
01:20:44,142 --> 01:20:46,546
You've sharpened your sword
with treachery.

599
01:20:47,450 --> 01:20:50,000
You've armoured your dead with unrest.

600
01:20:50,254 --> 01:20:54,254
Now, I'll be the end of you.

601
01:20:54,839 --> 01:20:58,169
Nökers! Don't interfere.

602
01:20:59,897 --> 01:21:03,447
I'll make the most of killing Osman.

603
01:22:32,456 --> 01:22:36,046
Kill him! Don't let him get away!

604
01:22:36,866 --> 01:22:38,926
I'm here, Osman!

605
01:22:41,834 --> 01:22:44,794
I'm here, Osman!

606
01:23:02,378 --> 01:23:03,708
My Osman!

607
01:23:04,015 --> 01:23:07,295
Osman! I'm here, Osman!

608
01:23:08,070 --> 01:23:10,410
I'm here, my Osman!

609
01:23:11,807 --> 01:23:14,707
Balgay! Balgay is running away, my Osman!
Let's go!

610
01:23:14,707 --> 01:23:17,457
Göktuğ! Göktuğ killed his brother.

611
01:23:18,061 --> 01:23:21,371
Konur is injured, Bamsı Bey.
I'll go, you take care of him!

612
01:23:22,375 --> 01:23:26,815
Konur! Konur! Son!

613
01:24:07,479 --> 01:24:14,019
Konur! Konur, don't!
Open your eyes, son!

614
01:24:14,019 --> 01:24:19,059
Open your eyes, son!
My heart can't stand more, son!

615
01:24:19,059 --> 01:24:23,269
It can't stand more! Son!
Open your eyes!

616
01:24:23,269 --> 01:24:28,109
Konur! Don't!
Son! Open your eyes!

617
01:24:29,206 --> 01:24:30,606
Bamsı Bey!

618
01:24:45,783 --> 01:24:49,783
You fell from grace!

619
01:24:50,254 --> 01:24:52,284
What did you do!?

620
01:24:53,302 --> 01:24:57,802
Don't, Bamsı Bey.
Don't kill my brother.

621
01:25:02,700 --> 01:25:05,320
Bamsı Bey, enough! Enough.

622
01:25:08,580 --> 01:25:11,810
Balgay took him from us. Don't do it.

623
01:25:22,949 --> 01:25:26,369
All of you will die like dogs.

624
01:25:27,180 --> 01:25:29,000
Like dogs...

625
01:26:16,415 --> 01:26:20,415
They've raced,
they've danced...

626
01:26:20,528 --> 01:26:22,538
The feast was beautiful.

627
01:26:24,893 --> 01:26:28,893
You used to dance so nicely.
I wish you came.

628
01:26:30,429 --> 01:26:32,539
I waited for you. But you didn't come.

629
01:26:35,479 --> 01:26:40,459
- Aygül.
- My brother came. He called me.

630
01:26:43,700 --> 01:26:47,330
I told him about the feast and the games.

631
01:26:47,580 --> 01:26:51,900
How nice of you! But you
left before telling us, Aygül.

632
01:26:52,311 --> 01:26:54,181
We got worried.

633
01:26:56,967 --> 01:27:01,727
Don't worry about me.
My brother is always with me.

634
01:27:02,219 --> 01:27:06,099
He'll protect me.
Don't worry.

635
01:27:07,443 --> 01:27:10,473
Come on, Aygül.
We should return to our Tent.

636
01:27:28,394 --> 01:27:30,714
Will you take good care of Osman Bey?

637
01:27:32,480 --> 01:27:35,560
I will, Aygül. Don't worry.

638
01:27:36,715 --> 01:27:37,995
Let's go.

639
01:27:39,958 --> 01:27:41,568
Also my baby...

640
01:27:42,457 --> 01:27:46,457
I promised you.
Of course I will.

641
01:27:49,706 --> 01:27:51,256
Let's go.

642
01:27:52,303 --> 01:27:56,003
- Aygül Hatun!
- Aygül! Daughter!

643
01:27:56,396 --> 01:27:59,956
- Aygül!
- Aygül!

644
01:28:01,793 --> 01:28:04,423
My daughter!

645
01:28:06,791 --> 01:28:10,791
My daughter! My Aygül!

646
01:28:24,718 --> 01:28:25,908
Stop!

647
01:28:26,797 --> 01:28:30,547
Don't eat the food!

648
01:28:33,885 --> 01:28:37,525
This traitor poisoned the food!

649
01:28:37,996 --> 01:28:39,096
Eat it.

650
01:28:39,743 --> 01:28:40,963
Coward!

651
01:28:44,495 --> 01:28:45,665
Daughter?

652
01:28:53,482 --> 01:28:57,482
I'll take your life
if you try to take ours!

653
01:28:59,457 --> 01:29:00,577
Mother!

654
01:29:22,763 --> 01:29:24,093
Mother!

655
01:29:34,326 --> 01:29:35,686
My daughter.

656
01:29:39,182 --> 01:29:40,382
My daughter.

657
01:29:43,500 --> 01:29:45,040
Mother!

658
01:29:52,647 --> 01:29:54,257
Mother!

659
01:29:55,859 --> 01:29:59,029
Okay, okay.
Please stop.

660
01:30:03,974 --> 01:30:09,224
Come on, come on my daughter, let's go
back to our tribe.

661
01:30:31,349 --> 01:30:35,409
Mother!

662
01:30:52,706 --> 01:30:57,046
My Bey, this is my bequest.

663
01:30:57,729 --> 01:31:03,339
Don't let Balgay take Göktuğ.

664
01:31:07,029 --> 01:31:13,339
Don't worry. I will make Göktuğ my Alp.

665
01:31:15,030 --> 01:31:19,230
Okay, don't tire yourself up.

666
01:31:20,609 --> 01:31:22,659
- Dumrul.
- My Bey.

667
01:31:22,659 --> 01:31:25,376
Cauterize right now.

668
01:31:35,331 --> 01:31:37,531
Göktuğ.

669
01:31:42,686 --> 01:31:46,886
They destroyed your sanity.

670
01:31:48,246 --> 01:31:52,286
They owned your soul.

671
01:31:53,728 --> 01:31:58,118
Göktuğ.
Wake up.

672
01:31:59,007 --> 01:32:02,437
Bismillahirrahmanirrahim
(in the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.)

673
01:32:04,621 --> 01:32:08,541
Don't you see your brother's condition?

674
01:32:14,564 --> 01:32:19,284
Göktuğ, how could you do that?

675
01:32:24,127 --> 01:32:29,547
Thank your brother that I gave my word
to him.

676
01:32:29,547 --> 01:32:30,747
Or else...

677
01:32:45,779 --> 01:32:47,999
Osman.

678
01:32:47,999 --> 01:32:52,199
I took what I want, Balgay.
But...

679
01:32:52,543 --> 01:32:54,795
I will still keep my promise.

680
01:32:54,795 --> 01:33:01,651
When you gather the commanders under you,
I join your war and help you kill Geyhatu.

681
01:33:01,651 --> 01:33:08,271
However, if your soldiers act like Böke,
I will kill you by myself.

682
01:33:08,271 --> 01:33:15,561
You owe me now.
Valiants don't forget heir debt.

683
01:33:16,835 --> 01:33:20,215
I don't forget anything.

684
01:33:21,724 --> 01:33:26,954
Don't die until the day of our war.

685
01:33:41,697 --> 01:33:44,687
You trampled my honor.

686
01:33:44,754 --> 01:33:49,564
You took my son from me.

687
01:33:52,389 --> 01:33:56,709
My skin was thick, you couldn't bore.

688
01:33:56,805 --> 01:34:00,765
My weapon was blunt, you couldn't handle.

689
01:34:00,791 --> 01:34:07,201
I fought a thousand times,
I resurrected a thousand times.

690
01:34:07,201 --> 01:34:14,711
I have fought against you once, I have been
defeated a thousand times by you, Osman.

691
01:34:25,246 --> 01:34:28,732
No one can defeat the glorious Balgay.

692
01:34:28,732 --> 01:34:33,382
Balgay is still glorious Balgay.

693
01:34:33,611 --> 01:34:39,951
However, his glory is in Osman's hand.

694
01:34:54,418 --> 01:34:57,278
Where are you going, Balgay?

695
01:34:57,768 --> 01:35:03,608
I will take my glory back from Osman.

696
01:35:24,989 --> 01:35:29,699
Ghengis Khan's Nökers (soldiers)!

697
01:35:31,833 --> 01:35:36,263
Show your glory!

698
01:35:36,557 --> 01:35:42,727
May your anger take them down!

699
01:35:43,467 --> 01:35:48,047
No Kayı will be left alive!

700
01:35:48,185 --> 01:35:55,285
Make a mountain with the heads you take,
make a stream with the blood you shed!

701
01:35:55,865 --> 01:36:03,665
Tents, tribes, barns...
Burn it all down!

702
01:36:03,939 --> 01:36:10,278
Today, Erlik Han will be full of blood!

703
01:36:10,278 --> 01:36:13,611
Erlik Han will be full of blood!

704
01:36:13,611 --> 01:36:20,701
Erlik Han! Erlik Han!

705
01:36:32,342 --> 01:36:33,882
Hey death!

706
01:36:35,671 --> 01:36:38,411
Where is your victory?

707
01:36:38,596 --> 01:36:43,476
Hey death, where is your thorn?

708
01:36:46,252 --> 01:36:51,142
The messiah resurrected, you are defeated.

709
01:36:51,261 --> 01:36:56,631
The messiah resurrected, devils died.

710
01:36:56,631 --> 01:37:01,461
The messiah resurrected, angels delighted.

711
01:37:01,479 --> 01:37:05,279
The messiah resurrected, the vita
has risen.

712
01:37:05,279 --> 01:37:11,939
The messiah resurrected, everybody
resurrected.

713
01:37:12,014 --> 01:37:19,924
Because the messiah became the first
dead.

714
01:37:19,983 --> 01:37:24,743
Godspeed to him...

715
01:37:24,965 --> 01:37:29,945
-for ever. Amen!
-Amen!

716
01:37:30,763 --> 01:37:37,473
I don't want any Turk alive!

717
01:37:38,607 --> 01:37:42,677
Or I will kill you all!

718
01:37:44,694 --> 01:37:50,984
For my father, the head monk Yannis...

719
01:37:51,569 --> 01:37:56,439
For a world without Turks...

720
01:37:56,479 --> 01:38:05,229
Long live princess Sofia!

721
01:40:59,482 --> 01:41:01,712
Destroy!

722
01:41:02,633 --> 01:41:05,493
Destroy them!

723
01:41:06,314 --> 01:41:09,664
Don't show mercy!

724
01:42:07,349 --> 01:42:12,869
I am here! Where are you!

725
01:42:16,675 --> 01:42:22,818
The cowards hided in their tents!
I don't want any alive Turk!

726
01:42:22,818 --> 01:42:28,078
Find them all!
Kill them all! To the tents!

727
01:43:09,267 --> 01:43:12,267
This is a trap!

728
01:43:24,484 --> 01:43:28,254
That's a trap!
Trap!

729
01:47:11,668 --> 01:47:14,218
Run Run!

730
01:47:51,818 --> 01:47:54,728
Attack!

731
01:47:55,093 --> 01:47:59,013
Attack them!

732
01:48:01,287 --> 01:48:03,387
Come on, Hatuns!

733
01:50:17,872 --> 01:50:19,642
Don't forget, son...

734
01:50:21,309 --> 01:50:26,549
...it's the most important discipline
of Islam's very old history.

735
01:50:27,255 --> 01:50:32,085
When Muslims fall apart, unbelievers rise.

736
01:50:33,395 --> 01:50:39,115
Your duty is to get yourself together.

737
01:50:40,765 --> 01:50:42,595
Kayı Tent...

738
01:50:42,828 --> 01:50:47,818
...is the archery hill of
Muslims in Bithynia.

739
01:50:49,120 --> 01:50:51,460
If we leave there...

740
01:50:51,540 --> 01:50:55,180
...unbelievers will double their cruelty.

741
01:50:56,855 --> 01:51:00,855
Now, protect your Tent..

742
01:51:01,720 --> 01:51:03,850
...and action.

743
01:51:04,172 --> 01:51:08,552
So that Muslims rise and
unbelievers fall apart.

744
01:51:23,271 --> 01:51:25,011
Osman...

745
01:51:25,528 --> 01:51:30,078
So, you ran away from Balgay.

746
01:51:33,160 --> 01:51:35,880
Göktuğ! How could you
kill your brother?

747
01:51:36,450 --> 01:51:40,280
Do you think I only killed that dog?

748
01:51:42,829 --> 01:51:44,999
I destroyed your whole Tent.

749
01:51:47,629 --> 01:51:51,409
- What are you saying?
- Commander Subutay...

750
01:51:51,592 --> 01:51:54,722
...will raid your Tent with Sofia.

751
01:51:54,864 --> 01:51:57,714
They'll kill everyone.

752
01:51:59,382 --> 01:52:01,432
You're late, Osman.

753
01:52:01,692 --> 01:52:02,922
You're late.

754
01:52:06,117 --> 01:52:10,117
That's my gift for you
before you die.

755
01:52:10,828 --> 01:52:13,188
When you arrive at your Tent...

756
01:52:13,624 --> 01:52:18,324
...everyone will be dead.

757
01:52:18,390 --> 01:52:21,830
They'll raid our Tent, Osman!

758
01:52:26,282 --> 01:52:30,042
They set a trap to our minds and anger...

759
01:52:30,251 --> 01:52:32,501
...with Sıddık and Göktuğ.

760
01:52:34,154 --> 01:52:37,614
We are far away from the Tent, Osman Bey.
How will we reach there?

761
01:52:37,680 --> 01:52:40,210
As soon as possible, Bahadır.

762
01:52:40,328 --> 01:52:43,338
Till we have our own graves.

763
01:52:43,654 --> 01:52:46,144
We don't know what we'll face in the Tent.

764
01:52:46,609 --> 01:52:47,769
Dumrul.

765
01:52:48,044 --> 01:52:51,604
Look after these two.
Take care of Konur.

766
01:52:55,830 --> 01:52:59,090
- Look after him.
- Your command, my Bey.

767
01:52:59,117 --> 01:53:01,367
We'll go to the Tent immediately.

768
01:53:01,421 --> 01:53:03,681
Shahada road is waiting for us!

769
01:53:04,054 --> 01:53:08,054
Allah will help us...

770
01:53:08,505 --> 01:53:11,985
...and Hızır will be our comrade on
this road.

771
01:53:12,130 --> 01:53:13,420
Come on!

772
01:54:25,826 --> 01:54:28,536
- Give me your blessings.
- I will.

773
01:54:28,603 --> 01:54:30,593
I thought you were bad...

774
01:54:34,380 --> 01:54:36,390
Look at me, Hazal.

775
01:54:37,529 --> 01:54:40,069
Don't try my patience.

776
01:54:40,432 --> 01:54:43,512
Now tell me what your problem is or...

777
01:54:43,579 --> 01:54:48,859
...I'll make you regret the day you
were born and make you say it.

778
01:54:51,384 --> 01:54:55,384
I got some news from my brother.

779
01:54:56,871 --> 01:55:01,331
Subutay will raid the Tent.

780
01:55:09,490 --> 01:55:12,940
You saved the Tent, Hazal Hatun.
Thank you so much.

781
01:55:13,035 --> 01:55:15,175
Thanks to my brother.

782
01:55:15,211 --> 01:55:19,971
These dogs would kill all of us if he
didn't tell me. Come on!

783
01:57:41,492 --> 01:57:44,232
You can't stop a tiger, Osman.

784
01:57:47,319 --> 01:57:49,659
Traitors' fate is...

785
01:57:51,136 --> 01:57:53,706
...the grasp of...

786
01:57:54,206 --> 01:57:56,406
...fearless, Subutay.

787
01:57:59,323 --> 01:58:02,203
I'll kill you.

788
01:58:33,517 --> 01:58:35,907
Are you looking for us, Sofia?

789
01:58:36,082 --> 01:58:37,142
Come here.

790
01:59:26,085 --> 01:59:27,905
Allah is eternal!

791
01:59:30,530 --> 01:59:32,200
Attack!

792
01:59:41,666 --> 01:59:44,796
Fight, valiants!

793
01:59:44,854 --> 01:59:48,014
Kill all of them!
Allahu Akbar!

794
01:59:59,837 --> 02:00:01,747
You're late, Balgay.

795
02:00:02,002 --> 02:00:04,642
They got news about raid
and took precautions.

796
02:00:04,888 --> 02:00:06,928
Osman arrived just in time.

797
02:00:07,383 --> 02:00:09,983
I swear that...

798
02:00:10,601 --> 02:00:16,031
...I won't ever stop, Osman.

799
02:00:16,699 --> 02:00:18,999
I'll take back my son Kongar...

800
02:00:19,146 --> 02:00:21,586
...from you.

801
02:00:22,220 --> 02:00:25,250
I'll torture you to dead, Osman.

802
02:00:25,749 --> 02:00:27,649
I'll torture you!

803
02:01:17,903 --> 02:01:23,313
Come on, valiants! Today
is the Shahada day!

804
02:01:23,533 --> 02:01:25,253
Kill them all!

805
02:01:33,353 --> 02:01:37,473
I came with a Mongol anger!

806
02:01:38,668 --> 02:01:41,468
You'll drown in Turk's revenge, Subutay.

807
02:01:55,548 --> 02:02:58,268
Please contact turkision@gmail.com
for any inquiries